ES AND FOREIGN CURRENCY FUTURES MARKETS WITH RISK LIMITED TO THE AMOUNT OF THEIR TRADE CHICAGO , MARCH 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CME GROUP ,\xa0THE WORLD'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT IS INTRODUCING EVENT-BASED CONTRACTS DESIGNED FOR THE RETAIL AUDIENCE THAT WILL MAKE IT EASIER FOR EVERYONE TO TRADE THEIR VIEWS ON DAILY UP OR DOWN PRICE MOVES IN SOME OF THE WORLD'S MOST WIDELY QUOTED BENCHMARK FUTURES MARKETS, INCLUDING GOLD, OIL, EQUITY INDICES AND FOREIGN CURRENCIES. THESE NEW DAILY OPTIONS ON FUTURES CONTRACTS WILL OFFER SHORT-TERM TRADING OPPORTUNITIES FOR INDIVIDUALS SEEKING TO TAKE A POSITION ON DAILY PRICE MOVES USING SMALLER-VALUE TRADES OF UP TO $20 PER CONTRACT."}{'symbol': 'CMCSA', 'date': '2022-03-14 09:30:00', 'title': 'COMCAST ADVERTISING ROLLS OUT NATIONWIDE, MULTI-SCREEN MEDIA SOLUTION FOR PREMIUM TV ADVERTISING WITH THE RELAUNCH OF ITS AUDIENCEXPRESS BRAND', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY, COMCAST ADVERTISING ANNOUNCED THAT ITS MARKET-LEADING MEDIA SOLUTIONS ALLOWING U.S. ADVERTISERS TO BUY PREMIUM TV ADVERTISING ON AN AUDIENCE BASIS NATIONWIDE ACROSS ALL SCREENS, INCLUDING BROADCAST, CABLE, DIGITAL AND CONNECTED TV (CTV), WILL BE RELAUNCHED UNDER THE AUDIENCEXPRESS BRAND. FREEWHEEL MEDIA, THE MEDIA SOLUTIONS TEAM WITHIN FREEWHEEL, WILL NOW BE IN MARKET UNDER THE AUDIENCEXPRESS BRAND. AUDIENCEXPRESS AUTOMATES THE WAY ADVERTISERS REACH AUDIENCES A'}{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-03-14 11:00:00', 'title': 'COMERICA BANK FOCUSES ON SMALL BUSINESS AND CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE WITH ADDITION OF TWO LEADERSHIP POSITIONS', 'text': 'DALLAS, MARCH 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COMERICA INCORPORATED (NYSE: CMA) ANNOUNCED THE ADDITION OF TWO KEY MEMBERS TO ITS RETAIL BANK DIVISION WITH THE HIRING OF OMAR SALAH, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, DIRECTOR, SMALL BUSINESS BANKING,\xa0AND BRIAN HANEY , SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, DIRECTOR, STRATEGY & TRANSFORMATION. BOTH WILL REPORT TO CASSANDRA MCKINNEY, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR, RETAIL BANK.'}{'symbol': 'DHI', 'date': '2022-03-14 12:18:00', 'title': 'D.R. HORTON, INC. TO RELEASE 2022 SECOND QUARTER EARNINGS ON APRIL 26, 2022', 'text': 'ARLINGTON, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $DHI #EARNINGS--D.R. HORTON ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL RELEASE FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR ITS SECOND QUARTER ENDED MARCH 31, 2022 ON TUESDAY, APRIL 26, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'DXCM', 'date': '2022-03-14 03:30:00', 'title': 'DEXCOM G7 RECEIVES CE MARK – NEXT-GENERATION CONTINUOUS GLUCOSE MONITORING SYSTEM TO REVOLUTIONIZE DIABETES MANAGEMENT', 'text': 'EDINBURGH, SCOTLAND & SAN DIEGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $DXCM #CGM--DEXCOM G7 RECEIVES CE MARK – NEXT GENERATION CONTINUOUS GLUCOSE MONITORING SYSTEM TO REVOLUTIONIZE DIABETES MANAGEMENT'}{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2022-03-14 17:15:00', 'title': 'EQUIFAX BECOMES FIRST CONSUMER REPORTING AGENCY TO ACHIEVE FEDRAMP READY DESIGNATION', 'text': "EQUIFAX CLOUD™ BASED SERVICES NOW LISTED IN THE FEDRAMP MARKETPLACE ATLANTA, MARCH 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 EQUIFAX ® (NYSE: EFX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT IS THE FIRST CONSUMER REPORTING AGENCY TO ACHIEVE A FEDERAL RISK AND AUTHORIZATION MANAGEMENT PROGRAM (FEDRAMP) 'READY FOR AGENCY AUTHORIZATION,' A DESIGNATION ENABLED BY THE $1.5 BILLION EQUIFAX TECHNOLOGY AND SECURITY TRANSFORMATION. THE NEWLY-LISTED EQUIFAX GOVERNMENT DATA EXCHANGE SYSTEM IS AN APPLICATION PROGRAMMING INTERFACE (API)-BASED DELIVERY CHANNEL THAT ENABLES SECURE ACCESS TO REAL-TIME INCOME AND EMPLOYMENT VERIFICATION SERVICES FROM THE WORK NUMBER ®."}{'symbol': 'FRC', 'date': '2022-03-14 08:00:00', 'title': 'FIRST REPUBLIC BANK BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPOINTS MIKE ROFFLER AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FIRST REPUBLIC BANK (NYSE:FRC), A LEADING PRIVATE BANK AND WEALTH MANAGEMENT COMPANY, ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS NAMED MIKE ROFFLER CEO OF THE COMPANY EFFECTIVE MARCH 13, 2022. ROFFLER WILL ALSO CONTINUE TO SERVE AS PRESIDENT AND BOARD MEMBER. GEORGE G.C. PARKER, ACTING CHAIRMAN AND BOARD MEMBER, SAID: “WE ARE EXCEEDINGLY PLEASED TO APPOINT MIKE AS FIRST REPUBLIC'S CEO. MIKE FULLY EMBODIES OUR CULTURE, HAS A DEEP KNOWLEDGE OF OUR BUSINESS MODEL, AN"}{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-03-14 16:30:00', 'title': 'HII DELIVERS VIRGINIA-CLASS SUBMARINE MONTANA (SSN 794) TO U.S. NAVY', 'text': "NEWPORT NEWS, VA., MARCH 14, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII, AMERICA'S LARGEST SHIPBUILDER AND LEADING PROVIDER OF MISSION-DRIVEN DEFENSE TECHNOLOGIES, ON FRIDAY DELIVERED THE NEWEST VIRGINIA-CLASS FAST-ATTACK SUBMARINE TO THE U.S. NAVY."}{'symbol': 'ILMN', 'date': '2022-03-14 09:15:00', 'title': 'ILLUMINA WELCOMES CARISSA ROLLINS AS CHIEF INFORMATION OFFICER', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, MARCH 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ILLUMINA, INC. (NASDAQ: ILMN) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT CARISSA ROLLINS WILL JOIN THE COMPANY AS CHIEF INFORMATION OFFICER ON MARCH 14, 2022. ROLLINS BRINGS OVER 30 YEARS OF BUSINESS TECHNOLOGY TRANSFORMATION AND DIGITAL AND CONSUMERIZATION STRATEGY EXPERIENCE.'}{'symbol': 'LKQ', 'date': '2022-03-14 09:09:00', 'title': "ONE EQUITY PARTNERS TO ACQUIRE LKQ CORPORATION'S PGW AUTO GLASS BUSINESS", 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ONE EQUITY PARTNERS TO ACQUIRE LKQ CORPORATION'S PGW AUTO GLASS BUSINESS"}{'symbol': 'LKQ', 'date': '2022-03-14 09:00:00', 'title': 'LKQ CORPORATION AGREES TO SELL PGW AUTO GLASS BUSINESS TO ONE EQUITY PARTNERS', 'text': 'CHICAGO, MARCH 14, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- LKQ CORPORATION (NASDAQ: LKQ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO SELL PGW AUTO GLASS (“PGW”), A DISTRIBUTOR OF AFTERMARKET GLASS TO THE NORTH AMERICAN AUTOMOTIVE SECTOR, TO ONE EQUITY PARTNERS. THE TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED DURING THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2022 AND IS SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS AND NECESSARY REGULATORY APPROVALS.'}{'symbol': 'LMT', 'date': '2022-03-14 13:00:00', 'title': 'LOCKHEED MARTIN ANNOUNCES NEW SKUNK WORKS® LEADER', 'text': 'FORT WORTH, TEXAS, MARCH 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LOCKHEED MARTIN (NYSE:LMT) 